WEBVTT

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:30.851
Well, I decided right then and right there

00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:33.167
that ballet was dumb.

00:02:33.542 --> 00:02:34.917
(Laughter)

00:02:35.917 --> 00:02:39.018
You know, I had lots of experiences
like that along the way,

00:02:39.042 --> 00:02:41.059
but as I got older,

00:02:41.083 --> 00:02:43.601
I started to get angry.

00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:48.101
And not just angry
at the outright racism and injustice.

00:02:48.125 --> 00:02:52.042
I was angry at people
that stood by and didn't say anything.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.893
Like, why didn't the white parents
in that ballet school say

00:02:57.917 --> 00:02:59.934
"Uh, that's wrong.

00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:01.625
Let that little girl dance."